[38;2;124;124;124mWe need to determine natural numbers $n$ for which there exists a map $f: S^{2n}[0m[38;2;124;124;124m\to \mathbb{C}P^n$ such that $f$ induces an isomorphism $H^{2n}(\mathbb{C}P^n) [0m
