[38;2;124;124;124mActually wait, let me reconsider. $S^0$ is two points, so $H^0(S^0) = \mathbb{Z}[0m[38;2;124;124;124m^2$, while $H^0(\mathbb{C}P^0) = \mathbb{Z}$. So no isomorphism on $H^0$. So [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m$n=0$ is out.[0m

